{"page":299,"width":1767,"height":2582,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"8.3 교착상태특성 357","words":[{"text":"8.3","x":1204,"y":154,"width":55,"height":23},{"text":"교착상태특성","x":1275,"y":154,"width":157,"height":27},{"text":"357","x":1506,"y":150,"width":59,"height":29}]},{"text":"。 스레드 T2는 RI과 R2의 인스턴스를 각각 한 개씩 점유하고, 자원 유형 시의 인스","words":[{"text":"。","x":367,"y":293,"width":13,"height":14},{"text":"스레드","x":399,"y":283,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"T2는","x":510,"y":285,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"RI과","x":589,"y":282,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"R2의","x":669,"y":283,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"인스턴스를","x":748,"y":284,"width":151,"height":36},{"text":"각각","x":913,"y":284,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"한","x":986,"y":284,"width":32,"height":36},{"text":"개씩","x":1032,"y":283,"width":57,"height":37},{"text":"점유하고,","x":1108,"y":283,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"자원","x":1259,"y":283,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"유형","x":1337,"y":283,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"시의","x":1416,"y":283,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"인스","x":1504,"y":284,"width":62,"height":36}]},{"text":"던스 한 개를 기다린다.","words":[{"text":"던스","x":401,"y":344,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"한","x":478,"y":343,"width":32,"height":36},{"text":"개를","x":523,"y":342,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"기다린다.","x":597,"y":342,"width":128,"height":38}]},{"text":"。 스레드 저는 서의 인스턴스 한 개를 점유하고 있다.","words":[{"text":"。","x":370,"y":424,"width":12,"height":14},{"text":"스레드","x":402,"y":414,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"저는","x":512,"y":415,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"서의","x":589,"y":414,"width":65,"height":40},{"text":"인스턴스","x":670,"y":414,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"한","x":801,"y":416,"width":30,"height":35},{"text":"개를","x":844,"y":416,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"점유하고","x":916,"y":416,"width":122,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":1052,"y":416,"width":67,"height":37}]},{"text":"자원 할당 그래프의 정의로부터, 우리는 만일 그래프가 사이클(cycle)을 포함하지","words":[{"text":"자원","x":370,"y":526,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"할당","x":454,"y":526,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"그래프의","x":536,"y":526,"width":123,"height":37},{"text":"정의로부터,","x":679,"y":527,"width":159,"height":39},{"text":"우리는","x":854,"y":528,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"만일","x":961,"y":529,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"그래프가","x":1040,"y":529,"width":126,"height":37},{"text":"사이클(cycle)을","x":1181,"y":529,"width":240,"height":43},{"text":"포함하지","x":1437,"y":531,"width":126,"height":37}]},{"text":"않으면 시스템 내 어느 스레드도 교착 상태가 아니라는 것을 보일 수 있다. 반면, 그래프","words":[{"text":"않으면","x":308,"y":587,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"시스템","x":424,"y":586,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"내","x":535,"y":586,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"어느","x":579,"y":587,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"스레드도","x":653,"y":588,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"교착","x":788,"y":589,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"상태가","x":860,"y":589,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"아니라는","x":964,"y":589,"width":124,"height":37},{"text":"것을","x":1101,"y":590,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"보일","x":1175,"y":590,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1251,"y":590,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":1298,"y":590,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"반면,","x":1384,"y":591,"width":72,"height":37},{"text":"그래프","x":1470,"y":592,"width":98,"height":36}]},{"text":"가 사이클을 포함하면 교착 상태가 존재할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"가","x":308,"y":648,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"사이클을","x":354,"y":647,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"포함하면","x":500,"y":647,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"교착","x":640,"y":648,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"상태가","x":713,"y":648,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"존재할","x":816,"y":649,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":919,"y":650,"width":30,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":962,"y":650,"width":66,"height":35}]},{"text":"만일 각 자원 유형이 정확하게 하나의 인스턴스만을 가지면, 하나의 사이클은 교착","words":[{"text":"만일","x":372,"y":708,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"각","x":454,"y":707,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"자원","x":501,"y":707,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"유형이","x":579,"y":708,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"정확하게","x":690,"y":709,"width":120,"height":37},{"text":"하나의","x":826,"y":710,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"인스턴스만을","x":933,"y":710,"width":183,"height":36},{"text":"가지면,","x":1131,"y":711,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"하나의","x":1248,"y":711,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"사이클은","x":1358,"y":712,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"교착","x":1502,"y":713,"width":66,"height":36}]},{"text":"상태가 발생하였음을 암시한다. 만일 사이클이 각각 하나의 인스턴스만 갖는 자원 유형","words":[{"text":"상태가","x":307,"y":768,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"발생하였음을","x":424,"y":768,"width":197,"height":35},{"text":"암시한다.","x":635,"y":769,"width":130,"height":36},{"text":"만일","x":782,"y":770,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"사이클이","x":856,"y":770,"width":118,"height":37},{"text":"각각","x":992,"y":771,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"하나의","x":1066,"y":771,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"인스턴스만","x":1174,"y":771,"width":159,"height":36},{"text":"갖는","x":1346,"y":772,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"자원","x":1424,"y":773,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"유형","x":1501,"y":773,"width":62,"height":36}]},{"text":"의 집합만을 포함한다면, 교착 상태가 발생한 것이다. 사이클에 포함된 각 스레드는 교착","words":[{"text":"의","x":307,"y":827,"width":29,"height":35},{"text":"집합만을","x":354,"y":827,"width":134,"height":36},{"text":"포함한다면,","x":500,"y":827,"width":169,"height":38},{"text":"교착","x":682,"y":829,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"상태가","x":755,"y":830,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"발생한","x":860,"y":830,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"것이다.","x":964,"y":831,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"사이클에","x":1075,"y":831,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"포함된","x":1211,"y":832,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"각","x":1317,"y":832,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"스레드는","x":1361,"y":833,"width":130,"height":35},{"text":"교착","x":1502,"y":834,"width":66,"height":35}]},{"text":"상태에 있다. 이 경우에 그래프 내의 한 사이클은 교착 상태가 존재하기 위한 필요, 충분","words":[{"text":"상태에","x":305,"y":886,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":425,"y":887,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":513,"y":888,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"경우에","x":558,"y":888,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"그래프","x":664,"y":889,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"내의","x":772,"y":890,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"한","x":844,"y":891,"width":32,"height":34},{"text":"사이클은","x":887,"y":890,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"교착","x":1022,"y":891,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"상태가","x":1094,"y":891,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"존재하기","x":1200,"y":891,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"위한","x":1339,"y":892,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"필요,","x":1416,"y":893,"width":71,"height":35},{"text":"충분","x":1501,"y":893,"width":67,"height":35}]},{"text":"조건이 된다.","words":[{"text":"조건이","x":304,"y":947,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"된다.","x":421,"y":948,"width":74,"height":35}]},{"text":"만일 각 자원 유형이 여러 개의 인스턴스를 가지면, 사이클이 반드시 교착 상태가 발","words":[{"text":"만일","x":370,"y":1007,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"각","x":451,"y":1008,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"자원","x":496,"y":1008,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"유형이","x":573,"y":1008,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"여러","x":683,"y":1009,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"개의","x":757,"y":1009,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"인스턴스를","x":832,"y":1010,"width":152,"height":35},{"text":"가지면,","x":996,"y":1010,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"사이클이","x":1108,"y":1010,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"반드시","x":1243,"y":1010,"width":90,"height":37},{"text":"교착","x":1349,"y":1011,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"상태가","x":1424,"y":1011,"width":101,"height":35},{"text":"발","x":1536,"y":1012,"width":33,"height":34}]},{"text":"생했음을 의미하지는 않는다. 이 경우 그래프 내의 사이클은 교착 상태가 존재하는 데","words":[{"text":"생했음을","x":306,"y":1066,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"의미하지는","x":460,"y":1068,"width":163,"height":36},{"text":"않는다.","x":639,"y":1068,"width":101,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":759,"y":1069,"width":25,"height":34},{"text":"경우","x":805,"y":1069,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"그래프","x":880,"y":1070,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"내의","x":989,"y":1070,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"사이클은","x":1064,"y":1070,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"교착","x":1203,"y":1071,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"상태가","x":1279,"y":1071,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"존재하는","x":1388,"y":1071,"width":133,"height":35},{"text":"데","x":1537,"y":1072,"width":28,"height":35}]},{"text":"필요조건이며 충분조건이 되지는 않는다.","words":[{"text":"필요조건이며","x":307,"y":1127,"width":199,"height":37},{"text":"충분조건이","x":521,"y":1128,"width":158,"height":36},{"text":"되지는","x":696,"y":1128,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"않는다.","x":801,"y":1129,"width":99,"height":36}]},{"text":"이 개념을 설명하기 위해, 그림 8.4의 자원 할당 그래프를 살펴보자. 스레드 T3가 자","words":[{"text":"이","x":373,"y":1188,"width":28,"height":36},{"text":"개념을","x":420,"y":1188,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"설명하기","x":532,"y":1188,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"위해,","x":673,"y":1188,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"그림","x":756,"y":1189,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"8.4의","x":831,"y":1190,"width":72,"height":35},{"text":"자원","x":918,"y":1190,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"할당","x":992,"y":1190,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"그래프를","x":1066,"y":1190,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"살펴보자.","x":1200,"y":1190,"width":132,"height":35},{"text":"스레드","x":1346,"y":1191,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"T3가","x":1454,"y":1191,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"자","x":1536,"y":1192,"width":34,"height":36}]},{"text":"원 유형 R2의 인스턴스를 하나 요청한다고 가정하자. 사용 가능한 자원이 현재 없기 때","words":[{"text":"원","x":309,"y":1247,"width":33,"height":34},{"text":"유형","x":356,"y":1248,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"R2의","x":438,"y":1248,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"인스턴스를","x":527,"y":1248,"width":160,"height":35},{"text":"하나","x":699,"y":1249,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"요청한다고","x":776,"y":1250,"width":157,"height":36},{"text":"가정하자.","x":946,"y":1250,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"사용","x":1091,"y":1250,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"가능한","x":1168,"y":1250,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"자원이","x":1272,"y":1250,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"현재","x":1379,"y":1251,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"없기","x":1458,"y":1251,"width":59,"height":37},{"text":"때","x":1536,"y":1253,"width":29,"height":35}]},{"text":"문에, 요청 간선 T3 - R2를 그래프에 추가한다(그림 8.5). 이 시점에서 시스템 내에 두","words":[{"text":"문에,","x":309,"y":1307,"width":77,"height":38},{"text":"요청","x":401,"y":1309,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"간선","x":483,"y":1309,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"T3","x":563,"y":1312,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"-","x":611,"y":1322,"width":33,"height":10},{"text":"R2를","x":656,"y":1310,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"그래프에","x":739,"y":1310,"width":123,"height":37},{"text":"추가한다(그림","x":877,"y":1310,"width":196,"height":39},{"text":"8.5).","x":1089,"y":1313,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":1169,"y":1311,"width":25,"height":35},{"text":"시점에서","x":1212,"y":1311,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"시스템","x":1349,"y":1311,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"내에","x":1458,"y":1312,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"두","x":1535,"y":1315,"width":33,"height":34}]},{"text":"개의 최소의 사이클이 존재한다.","words":[{"text":"개의","x":312,"y":1368,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"최소의","x":393,"y":1369,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"사이클이","x":504,"y":1369,"width":126,"height":37},{"text":"존재한다.","x":644,"y":1370,"width":135,"height":37}]},{"text":"TI 시 T2놔 T3놔 R2 T","words":[{"text":"TI","x":635,"y":1455,"width":33,"height":38},{"text":"시","x":734,"y":1456,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"T2놔","x":836,"y":1456,"width":76,"height":38},{"text":"T3놔","x":1034,"y":1456,"width":75,"height":37},{"text":"R2","x":1130,"y":1455,"width":36,"height":38},{"text":"T","x":1229,"y":1456,"width":23,"height":28}]},{"text":"T2 R3 T3 R2 T2","words":[{"text":"T2","x":636,"y":1499,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"R3","x":736,"y":1499,"width":36,"height":38},{"text":"T3","x":837,"y":1500,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"R2","x":935,"y":1500,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"T2","x":1034,"y":1499,"width":34,"height":37}]},{"text":"스레드 TI, T2, 그리고 뙤는 교착 상태이다. 스레드 T2는 스레드 T3이 점유하고 있는 자","words":[{"text":"스레드","x":316,"y":1592,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"TI,","x":432,"y":1598,"width":46,"height":35},{"text":"T2,","x":492,"y":1598,"width":44,"height":35},{"text":"그리고","x":551,"y":1595,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"뙤는","x":660,"y":1598,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"교착","x":739,"y":1596,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"상태이다.","x":814,"y":1596,"width":132,"height":36},{"text":"스레드","x":960,"y":1596,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"T2는","x":1065,"y":1597,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"스레드","x":1142,"y":1596,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"T3이","x":1246,"y":1596,"width":61,"height":39},{"text":"점유하고","x":1325,"y":1595,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"있는","x":1463,"y":1595,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"자","x":1536,"y":1597,"width":34,"height":35}]},{"text":"원 R3을 기다린다. 스레드 T3는 반면에 스레드 지이나 T2가 자원 R2를 방출하기를 기다","words":[{"text":"원","x":318,"y":1652,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"R3을","x":364,"y":1653,"width":75,"height":39},{"text":"기다린다.","x":453,"y":1654,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"스레드","x":605,"y":1656,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"T3는","x":713,"y":1658,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"반면에","x":791,"y":1656,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"스레드","x":896,"y":1657,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"지이나","x":1001,"y":1656,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"T2가","x":1108,"y":1656,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"자원","x":1184,"y":1656,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"R2를","x":1256,"y":1657,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"방출하기를","x":1336,"y":1655,"width":157,"height":35},{"text":"기다","x":1506,"y":1656,"width":64,"height":36}]},{"text":"RI","words":[{"text":"RI","x":873,"y":1795,"width":30,"height":29}]},{"text":"TI","words":[{"text":"TI","x":797,"y":1994,"width":24,"height":32}]},{"text":"그림 8.5 교착 상태를 갖는 자원 할당 그래프","words":[{"text":"그림","x":700,"y":2389,"width":49,"height":27},{"text":"8.5","x":758,"y":2391,"width":40,"height":22},{"text":"교착","x":826,"y":2389,"width":49,"height":26},{"text":"상태를",